WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,260 --> 00:00:02,700
Stop lecturing me here

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,980
What do you think

3
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,300
Speak nicely

4
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,320
Bring out the evidence

5
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:11,160
Of course I have to find evidence, but since you like it so much

6
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,400
Use money to measure others

7
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,120
Then we will follow your rules

8
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:15,120
what does it mean

9
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,880
Make a bet. Do you dare to bet on anything?

10
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:19,160
Just bet on this necklace

11
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,680
Did Tingting take it?

12
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:21,840
If she took it

13
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:23,390
I'll compensate you 200,000

14
00:00:23,390 --> 00:00:25,310
Two hundred thousand pairs

15
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:27,190
But if it turns out she didn't take it

16
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:28,550
Resign yourself

17
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:30,590
You don't deserve to be disrespectful at all

18
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:32,110
who are you

19
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:34,110
And he became the master for her

20
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:36,310
If we only say that he is Chen Yundong’s boss

21
00:00:36,310 --> 00:00:40,790
This status is not qualified enough.

22
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:42,990
I am her sister-in-law

23
00:00:42,990 --> 00:00:45,870
They should be a family

24
00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:47,110
A poor family

25
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:48,550
Open your mouth and it’s two hundred thousand

26
00:00:48,550 --> 00:00:50,710
Who are you fooling? I don’t believe it.

27
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:53,740
Take it out

28
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:55,380
Give me the car keys, what are you going to do?

29
00:00:55,380 --> 00:01:00,750
Don't ask, give it to me

30
00:01:00,750 --> 00:01:03,030
If the necklace was really stolen by Tingting

31
00:01:03,030 --> 00:01:04,590
The car downstairs rules you

32
00:01:04,590 --> 00:01:07,040
It's more than two hundred thousand

33
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,360
we apologize to you

34
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:09,640
The compensation

35
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:10,880
Should be investigated

36
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:13,580
Just accept the investigation

37
00:01:13,580 --> 00:01:16,140
But if the necklace was not taken by Tingting

38
00:01:16,140 --> 00:01:18,180
You apologize to our family in public

39
00:01:18,180 --> 00:01:19,300
and resign immediately

40
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:20,660
Leave this school

41
00:01:20,660 --> 00:01:21,860
Teacher Li

42
00:01:21,860 --> 00:01:23,140
Do you dare to take this poison?
